message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Spectre: NINE EYES — Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  BOND film package for Spectre (2015), mission codename NINE EYES. Models the
  global surveillance programme: surveillance-network data-flow centralization,
  criminal-organisation cell structure (SPECTRE), and network geometry
  (connectivity, critical nodes). Deterministic, zero-mock, protocol-driven.
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Daniel Ari
    orcid: "0000-0001-6232-9096"
    affiliation: "Active Inference Institute"
keywords:
  - surveillance networks
  - data-flow centralization
  - criminal-organisation intelligence
  - cell compartmentalization
  - network geometry
  - critical nodes
  - active inference
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-04"
